Package: feroxbuster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast, simple, recursive content discovery tool written in Rust
 Feroxbuster is a tool designed to perform forced browsing.
 It uses wordlists to search for unlinked content in target directories.
 These resources may store sensitive information about web applications
 and operational systems, such as source code, credentials, internal
 network addressing, etc.
